// # Hostile ident-plus-string strcat
//
// Logline: Print a let-bound ident plus a string so emit-wasm must miss a two-string fold.
//
// Setup: One public main. Not all-string concat. Body is ident + STRING.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Let x be Hello, .
//   2. Print x plus mixed!.
//   3. A folded Hello, mixed! print is a lie.

pub fn main() {
    let x = "Hello, ";
    println(x + "mixed!");
}
